{"id": "3251966", "revid": "119536", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3251966", "title": "Vrabie de savan\u0103", "text": "Vrabia de savan\u0103 (\"Ammodramus humeralis\") este o specie de pas\u0103re din familia Passerellidae. Se g\u0103se\u0219te \u00een Argentina, Bolivia, Brazilia, Columbia, Guyana Francez\u0103, Guyana, Paraguay, Peru, Surinam, Uruguay \u0219i Venezuela. Habitatele sale naturale sunt savana uscat\u0103, paji\u0219tile subtropicale sau tropicale, umede sezonier sau inundate, \u0219i p\u0103\u0219unile."}
