{"id": "3253250", "revid": "41997", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3253250", "title": "\u0218tefan M\u0103rgeal\u0103", "text": "\u0218tefan M\u0103rgeal\u0103 (cunoscut \u0219i sub formele \u0218tefan Mardjel\u0103/Marcella/Margella; \u00een ; n. 1783, Principatul Moldovei \u2013 d. 5 martie 1850, Paris) a fost un jurist, lingvist \u0219i pedagog basarabean din prima jum\u0103tate a secolului al XIX-lea. Acesta este autorul unor dintre cele mai timpurii instrumente didactice ruso-rom\u00e2ne tip\u0103rite la Sankt Petersburg \u2013 \u00een special \"Gramatica ruso-rom\u00e2n\u0103\" (1827) \u0219i \"Gramatica ruseasc\u0103 \u00een limba valah\u0103\" (1828) \u2013 \u0219i un promotor al \u0219colilor de tip lan\u0441asterian \u00een Basarabia.\nBiografie.\nS-a n\u0103scut \u00een 1783 \u00een Principatul Moldovei, \u00eentr-o familie de boieri moldoveni. A urmat studii la Academia domneasc\u0103 din Ia\u0219i, unde a dob\u00e2ndit cuno\u0219tin\u021be de elino-greac\u0103, geometrie, latin\u0103 \u0219i francez\u0103. Ulterior s-a \u00eenscris la Universitatea din Amsterdam, \u00een cadrul facult\u0103\u021bii de drept, ob\u021bin\u00e2nd diploma \u00een \u0219tiin\u021be juridice; concomitent, a aprofundat studiul limbilor clasice \u0219i moderne, aspect ce i-a determinat traiectoria ulterioar\u0103 de lingvist.\nCariera \u00een Basarabia (1811\u20131817).\n\u00cen contextul r\u0103zboiului ruso-otoman (1806\u20131812), a fost cooptat \u00een aparatul administrativ al Principatelor. \u00cencep\u00e2nd cu 1816, a de\u021binut func\u021bia de \"nomofilax\" (consilier juridic) \u00een Comitetul Provizoriu al Basarabiei, particip\u00e2nd la comisia de ordonare a legisla\u021biei provinciale. Interesul s\u0103u pentru tip\u0103rituri \u0219colare s-a manifestat \u00een leg\u0103tur\u0103 cu activitatea Tipografiei arhiepiscopale din Chi\u0219in\u0103u, institu\u021bie care publica abecedare, catehisme \u0219i primele manuale bilingve (rus\u0103\u2013moldoveneasc\u0103).\nSankt Petersburg (1817\u20131828).\nDin 1817 a activat \u00een cadrul Colegiului Afacerilor Externe, iar din 1819 \u00een calitate de traduc\u0103tor de limb\u0103 moldoveneasc\u0103 la Departamentul Asiatic al MAE rus. Sub influen\u021ba mitropolitului Gavriil B\u0103nulescu-Bodoni \u0219i \u00een consonan\u021b\u0103 cu mi\u0219carea \u0219colilor mutuale , M\u0103rgeal\u0103 a tradus \u0219i elaborat materiale didactice pentru \u0219colile basarabene (abecedare, tabele de citire/scriere, aritmetic\u0103), a \u00eentocmit un \"Dic\u021bionar ruso\u2013moldovenesc\" (manuscris) \u0219i a preg\u0103tit manuale de gramatic\u0103 menite s\u0103 faciliteze \u00eenv\u0103\u021barea reciproc\u0103 a limbilor rom\u00e2n\u0103 \u0219i rus\u0103.\n\u00cen 1827 a publicat la Sankt Petersburg lucrarea \"\u0420\u043e\u0441\u0441\u0438\u0439\u0441\u043a\u043e-\u0420\u0443\u043c\u044b\u043d\u0441\u043a\u0430\u044f \u0413\u0440\u0430\u043c\u043c\u0430\u0442\u0438\u043a\u0430\" (\"Gramatica ruso-rom\u00e2n\u0103\"). Volumul (cartea I) con\u021bine un \"Sobraniie slov\" (colec\u021bie de cuvinte) \u00een 26 de rubrici tematice \u0219i \"Razgovor\u00ee\" (35 de dialoguri) de uz cotidian, tip\u0103rite \u00een rom\u00e2n\u0103 cu alfabet chirilic vechi av\u00e2nd tr\u0103s\u0103turi moldovene\u0219ti. Proiectata expunere sistematic\u0103 a regulilor gramaticale era destinat\u0103 unei a doua c\u0103r\u021bi. \u00cen 1828 a ap\u0103rut \u0420\u043e\u0441\u0441\u0438\u0439\u0441\u043a\u0430\u044f \u0433\u0440\u0430\u043c\u043c\u0430\u0442\u0438\u043a\u0430 \u043d\u0430 \u0432\u0430\u043b\u0430\u0445\u0441\u043a\u043e\u043c \u044f\u0437\u044b\u043a\u0435 (\"Gramatica ruseasc\u0103 \u00een limba valah\u0103\", 2 volume), con\u021bin\u00e2nd texte exemplificative \u0219i maxime cu ton moralizator, conforme exigen\u021belor cenzurii epocii.\nParis (1828\u20131850).\nStabilit la Paris, a fost asociat cu \"Soci\u00e9t\u00e9 de l\u2019enseignement mutuel\", unde a continuat promovarea metodei mutuale \u0219i a studiat raporturile lingvistice dintre rom\u00e2n\u0103 \u0219i francez\u0103, subliniind gradul ridicat de \u00eemprumuturi lexicale franceze \u00een limba rom\u00e2n\u0103. A dus o existen\u021b\u0103 modest\u0103 \u0219i a decedat la Paris la 5 martie 1850.\nActivitatea pedagogic\u0103 \u0219i iluminist\u0103.\nM\u0103rgeal\u0103 s-a remarcat ca sus\u021bin\u0103tor timpuriu al \u0219colilor lan\u0441asteriene \u00een Basarabia: a elaborat aproximativ 120 de tabele ini\u021biale de citire \u0219i circa 40 de tabele de aritmetic\u0103 \u00een rom\u00e2n\u0103/moldoveneasc\u0103, a tradus catehisme \u0219i abecedare pentru aceste \u0219coli \u0219i a proiectat un manual metodic pentru citire, scriere, aritmetic\u0103 \u0219i cusut (neaprobat pentru tipar). De asemenea, a colaborat cu cercul petersburghez al \"Societ\u0103\u021bii libere a \u0219colilor de \u00eenv\u0103\u021b\u0103tur\u0103 mutual\u0103\" (\"\u0412\u043e\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e\u0435 \u043e\u0431\u0449\u0435\u0441\u0442\u0432\u043e\"), \u00een contact cu pedagogi precum Nikolai Greci.\nIdei lingvistice.\n\u00cen prefa\u021ba \"Gramaticii ruso-rom\u00e2ne\", autorul justific\u0103 necesitatea lucr\u0103rii pentru \u201eoptzeci de mii de rom\u00e2ni din Basarabia\u201d afla\u021bi sub domina\u021bie rus\u0103 \u0219i pentru \u201ec\u00e2teva milioane de rom\u00e2ni de peste Prut \u0219i Dun\u0103re\u201d, precum \u0219i pentru ru\u0219ii interesa\u021bi de \u00eenv\u0103\u021barea limbii rom\u00e2ne. El subliniaz\u0103 dificultatea de a formula reguli pentru o limb\u0103 \u201enecodificat\u0103\u201d \u0219i lipsit\u0103 de terminologie tehnic\u0103 \u0219i recurge la vocabular tematic \u0219i dialoguri ca solu\u021bii practice.\nImplicare civic\u0103.\nA sprijinit mi\u0219carea eliberatoare greac\u0103 (\"Filiki Eteria\"), public\u00e2nd \"\u00cendrept\u0103\u021birea grecilor\" (1826), un text justificativ al revoltei \u00eempotriva domina\u021biei otomane.\nMo\u0219tenire.\nIstoriografia rom\u00e2nisticii din spa\u021biul rus consemneaz\u0103 \"Gramatica\" lui M\u0103rgeal\u0103 ca primul instrument practic ruso\u2013rom\u00e2n tip\u0103rit pentru uz \u0219colar \u0219i conversa\u021bional; vocabularul chirilic cu tr\u0103s\u0103turi moldovene\u0219ti ofer\u0103 material valoros pentru lexicologia istoric\u0103 a limbii rom\u00e2ne de \u00eenceput de secol XIX.\n* Tomul \u00eent\u00e2i\n* Tomul al doilea"}
